    <title>Monetary policy</title>
    <link>https://www.snb.ch/en/the-snb/mandates-goals/monetary-policy</link>
    <description>The Swiss National Bank publishes its monetary policy assessments on a quarterly basis - in March, June, September and December. In these reports it describes the current monetary environment and formulates its monetary policy intentions in the following quarter. The 'Monetary policy report' and the 'Economic situation from the vantage point of the delegates for regional economic relations' are published about two weeks after each monetary policy assessment. These reports are reprinted in the 'Quarterly Bulletin'.</description>
